{
  "id": "u06",
  "section": 1,
  "order": 6,
  "title": "Wants, needs & likes",
  "teTitle": "కావాలి, వద్దు",
  "cefr": "A2",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "Say what you want, refuse politely, and talk about what you like and don't like.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u06-i01",
      "te": "మీకు ఏం కావాలి?",
      "gloss": "What do you want?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీకు", "gloss": "to you (polite)" },
        { "te": "ఏం", "gloss": "what" },
        { "te": "కావాలి", "gloss": "is wanted / needed" }
      ],
      "tags": ["wants", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "Wanting is dative in Telugu: నాకు కావాలి (naaku kaavaali) = 'to me (it) is wanted' = I want."
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i02",
      "te": "నాకు కాఫీ కావాలి.",
      "gloss": "I want coffee.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "కాఫీ", "gloss": "coffee" },
        { "te": "కావాలి", "gloss": "is wanted" }
      ],
      "tags": ["wants", "food"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u06-i04", "u06-i11"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i03",
      "te": "టీ కావాలా, కాఫీ కావాలా?",
      "gloss": "Do you want tea or coffee?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "టీ", "gloss": "tea" },
        { "te": "కావాలా", "gloss": "is (it) wanted?" },
        { "te": "కాఫీ", "gloss": "coffee" },
        { "te": "కావాలా", "gloss": "is (it) wanted?" }
      ],
      "tags": ["wants", "food", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "Telugu skips 'or' in questions — just ask both with -ఆ: టీ కావాలా, కాఫీ కావాలా?"
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i04",
      "te": "నాకు వద్దు.",
      "gloss": "I don't want (it).",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "వద్దు", "gloss": "not wanted / no" }
      ],
      "tags": ["wants"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u06-i02", "u06-i06"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i05",
      "te": "ఇంకొంచెం అన్నం కావాలా?",
      "gloss": "Do you want a little more rice?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇంకొంచెం", "gloss": "a little more" },
        { "te": "అన్నం", "gloss": "rice" },
        { "te": "కావాలా", "gloss": "is (it) wanted?" }
      ],
      "tags": ["food", "questions", "hospitality"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "ఇంకా + కొంచెం merge into ఇంకొంచెం (inkonchem) 'a little more' — you'll hear it at every Telugu meal."
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i06",
      "te": "చాలు, చాలు!",
      "gloss": "Enough, enough!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "చాలు", "gloss": "enough" },
        { "te": "చాలు", "gloss": "enough" }
      ],
      "tags": ["food", "hospitality"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "చాలు (chaalu) is the only word that slows down a Telugu host. Say it twice, hand over the plate, for full effect.",
      "distractors": ["u06-i04", "u06-i13"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i07",
      "te": "నాకు మామిడిపండు అంటే ఇష్టం.",
      "gloss": "I like mangoes.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "మామిడిపండు", "gloss": "mango" },
        { "te": "అంటే", "gloss": "if (you) say / as for" },
        { "te": "ఇష్టం", "gloss": "liking" }
      ],
      "tags": ["likes", "food"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "The pattern for likes: X అంటే ఇష్టం (X anTee ishTam), literally 'if you say X — liking'."
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i08",
      "te": "మీకు ఏం ఇష్టం?",
      "gloss": "What do you like?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీకు", "gloss": "to you (polite)" },
        { "te": "ఏం", "gloss": "what" },
        { "te": "ఇష్టం", "gloss": "liking" }
      ],
      "tags": ["likes", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i09",
      "te": "ఈ పాట నాకు నచ్చింది.",
      "gloss": "I liked this song.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఈ", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "పాట", "gloss": "song" },
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "నచ్చింది", "gloss": "it pleased" }
      ],
      "tags": ["likes"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "నచ్చింది (nachchindi) = 'it pleased (me)' — the liked thing is the subject, and you are నాకు.",
      "distractors": ["u06-i10", "u06-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i10",
      "te": "ఇది నాకు నచ్చలేదు.",
      "gloss": "I didn't like this.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "నచ్చలేదు", "gloss": "didn't please" }
      ],
      "tags": ["likes"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u06-i09", "u06-i04"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i11",
      "te": "నాకు నీళ్ళు కావాలి.",
      "gloss": "I need water.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "నీళ్ళు", "gloss": "water" },
        { "te": "కావాలి", "gloss": "is needed" }
      ],
      "tags": ["needs", "food"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "నీళ్ళు (niiLLu) 'water' is grammatically plural in Telugu — 'waters'!",
      "distractors": ["u06-i02", "u06-i12"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i12",
      "te": "కారం వద్దు.",
      "gloss": "No chili spice, please.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కారం", "gloss": "chili heat / spice" },
        { "te": "వద్దు", "gloss": "not wanted" }
      ],
      "tags": ["food", "needs"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u06-i13",
      "te": "నాకు కొంచెం చాలు.",
      "gloss": "A little is enough for me.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
